     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Jim,<div>Sorry for the late reply:</div><div>The class &quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Monaco,Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12.800000190734863px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">org.renjin.cran.prodlim.</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Monaco,Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12.800000190734863px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">prodlim&quot; would be where Renjin expects to find the java class file containing the transpiled C/Fortran code.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Monaco,Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12.800000190734863px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Monaco,Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12.800000190734863px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">You can find the build log for this package here:</span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Monaco, Menlo, Consolas, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><a href=\"http://packages.renjin.org/packages/prodlim.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://packages.renjin.org/packages/prodlim.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793344124094000&amp;usg=AOvVaw15Oe5DI3eoQqiiscEybc2O\">http://packages.renjin.org/packages/prodlim.html</a></span></font><br></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Monaco, Menlo, Consolas, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Monaco, Menlo, Consolas, Courier New, monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\">And it looks like our C-to-Java translator failed because we don&#39;t have an emuluation function for &quot;srand&quot;.</span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Monaco,Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12.800000190734863px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><br></span></div><div><pre style=\"padding:9.5px;font-family:Monaco,Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:13px;color:rgb(51,51,51);border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:20px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.14902);background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">Caused by: java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: No matching method for srand\r\n\tat org.renjin.gcc.translate.MethodTable.resolve(MethodTable.java:92)\r\n\tat org.renjin.gcc.translate.TranslationContext.resolveMethod(TranslationContext.java:82)\r\n\tat org.renjin.gcc.translate.TranslationContext.resolveMethod(TranslationContext.java:87)\r\n\tat org.renjin.gcc.translate.FunctionContext.resolveMethod(FunctionContext.java:61)\r\n\tat org.renjin.gcc.translate.call.StaticCallTranslator.writeCall(StaticCallTranslator.java:27)\r\n\tat org.renjin.gcc.translate.FunctionTranslator.visitCall(FunctionTranslator.java:108)\r\n\t... 28 more</pre></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">You can try to implement it here:</div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><a href=\"https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/blob/master/tools/gnur-runtime/src/main/java/org/renjin/gnur/RenjinCApi.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/blob/master/tools/gnur-runtime/src/main/java/org/renjin/gnur/RenjinCApi.java&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793344124094000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3PDbT2nE-XHiewF1QJZAes\">https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/blob/master/tools/gnur-runtime/src/main/java/org/renjin/gnur/RenjinCApi.java</a><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">And see if you can rebuild the package.</div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">I&#39;ve opened a ticket for the issue here:</div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><a href=\"https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues/73\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues/73&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793344124094000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2nRSUOxBTgKkA7MxYgLPKi\">https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/issues/73</a><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">Best,</div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">Alex</div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
    ],
